{"seq":1,"slug":"deep-learning-interp","title":"深度模型解释","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/explainable-ai/practice/deep-learning-interp","wordCount":1782,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"深度模型解释\">深度模型解释</h1><p>前几章的工具大多假设特征是表格里一列列有名字的变量——「年龄」「收入」「负债比」。可一张图片的特征是几十万个像素，一段文本的特征是上千个词向量维度，对它们做<a href=\"../global-methods/feature-importance\">置换重要性</a>或读 <a href=\"../local-methods/shap\">SHAP</a> 表格毫无意义。深度模型需要一套专门的解释工具，本篇从最基础的梯度显著性，一路讲到 2026 年最活跃的前沿——机制可解释性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>深度模型的解释工具按「解释的粒度」分成三层，从输入的敏感度一直深入到内部机制。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>输入归因</strong>：梯度显著性（Saliency / SmoothGrad / Grad-CAM）问「输入的哪个部分让输出变化最大」，其中积分梯度靠沿基线路径积分补上了「完备性」公理。</li>\n<li><strong>注意力线索</strong>：Transformer 的注意力权重常被当解释，但它只是线索而非忠实归因。</li>\n<li><strong>机制可解释性</strong>：用稀疏自编码器把多义神经元分解成单义特征，再用电路追踪构造可读的「替换模型」，追踪一次推理的因果路径。</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>作用层</th>\n<th>满足完备性</th>\n<th>抗噪</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>朴素梯度</td>\n<td>输入</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>差</td>\n<td>快速探查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SmoothGrad</td>\n<td>输入</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>较好</td>\n<td>去噪可视化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Grad-CAM</td>\n<td>高层卷积</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>CNN 区域定位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>积分梯度</td>\n<td>输入</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>需公理保证的归因</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选层的原则很简单：越往下越贵、越接近「理解模型」，也越远未到「一键可用」；无论哪一层，结果都要过忠实性检验，而不是把漂亮的热力图当成正确解释。</p>\n<h2 id=\"基于梯度的显著性\">基于梯度的显著性</h2><p>最朴素的想法：模型对哪个输入像素的预测最敏感，那个像素就最重要。而「敏感度」正是梯度——把输出对输入求偏导，得到一张显著性图（saliency map）。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nabla_x f_c(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的每个分量告诉你，微调对应像素会让类别 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 的得分变化多少。</p>\n<p>朴素梯度噪声大、容易饱和（在平坦区梯度接近 0 却不代表不重要）。一系列改进随之出现：<strong>SmoothGrad</strong> 对加噪输入的梯度取平均以去噪；<strong>Grad-CAM</strong> 用最后一个卷积层的梯度加权特征图，生成一张粗粒度但鲁棒的类别激活热力图，告诉你模型「看」图像的哪个区域；<strong>Guided Backprop</strong> 在反传时只保留正梯度，得到更锐利的边缘。Grad-CAM 因为作用在高层特征图、抗噪且与类别相关，至今仍是 CNN 可视化的实用首选。</p>\n<h2 id=\"积分梯度-带公理的归因\">积分梯度：带公理的归因</h2><p>朴素梯度有个理论缺陷——它不满足「完备性」：各像素贡献之和不等于预测与基线之差。积分梯度（Integrated Gradients, IG）修补了这一点。它选一个基线 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（通常是全黑图），沿从基线到输入的直线路径积分梯度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>IG</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>f</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{IG}_i(x) = (x_i - x&#x27;_i)\\times\\int_{\\alpha=0}^{1}\\frac{\\partial f\\big(x&#x27; + \\alpha(x - x&#x27;)\\big)}{\\partial x_i}\\,d\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">IG</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0519em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.502em;vertical-align:-0.9119em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.4445em;position:relative;top:-0.0011em;\">∫</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.564em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.7881em;margin-left:-0.4445em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8129em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9119em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.59em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.74em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>实现时用离散求和近似积分。IG 满足完备性（归因之和 = <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x) - f(x&#x27;)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0019em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>）和敏感性等公理——这与 <a href=\"../local-methods/shap\">SHAP</a> 的可加性是同一种「分账分干净」的精神，事实上 IG 和 SHAP 都属于满足公理的归因家族。代价是要选基线，而基线选择会显著改变结果（全黑图会让黑色物体的归因消失），这是 IG 的主要争议点。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>作用层</th>\n<th>满足完备性</th>\n<th>抗噪</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>朴素梯度</td>\n<td>输入</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>差</td>\n<td>快速探查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SmoothGrad</td>\n<td>输入</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>较好</td>\n<td>去噪可视化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Grad-CAM</td>\n<td>高层卷积</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>CNN 区域定位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>积分梯度</td>\n<td>输入</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>需公理保证的归因</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"注意力是不是解释\">注意力是不是解释</h2><p>Transformer 自带注意力权重，很多人直接把它当解释：「模型注意力集中在这个词上，所以它最重要。」但学界有一场著名争论——「Attention is not Explanation」与「Attention is not not Explanation」两派针锋相对。核心问题是：注意力权重高，不一定意味着那个 token 对最终输出贡献大，因为信息会在多层、多头之间被反复重组，注意力只是其中一个环节。结论是：注意力可视化能提供线索，但不能等同于忠实的归因，把它当成 SHAP 那样的贡献度来读是危险的。这正是<a href=\"evaluation-trust\">评估与可信度</a>里「忠实性」要拷问的对象。</p>\n<h2 id=\"机制可解释性-2026-的前沿\">机制可解释性：2026 的前沿</h2><p>前面所有方法都在解释「输入的哪部分重要」，机制可解释性（mechanistic interpretability）问一个更野心的问题：模型内部到底在算什么？它试图把神经网络逆向工程成人能读懂的「特征」和「电路」。</p>\n<p>最大的障碍是<strong>多义性（polysemanticity）</strong>：单个神经元往往同时响应多个无关概念，无法直接解读。突破口是<strong>稀疏自编码器（SAE）</strong>：用一个稀疏字典把内部激活分解成大量「单义」特征，每个特征只对应一个可解释的概念。Anthropic 的研究显示，人类评估者认为这样提取的特征约 70% 是真正可解释的，远超神经元级方法（来源：galileo.ai/blog/anthropic-ai-interpretability-breakthrough）。</p>\n<p>2025 年 Anthropic 进一步推出<strong>电路追踪（circuit tracing）</strong>：用跨层转码器（一种 SAE 变体）替换模型的 MLP，构造出一个由可读特征组成的「替换模型」，再为单个 prompt 画出<strong>归因图（attribution graph）</strong>——节点是激活的特征、边是它们之间的线性依赖，从而追踪一次具体推理的因果路径；相关工具已于 2025 年 5 月开源（来源：intuitionlabs.ai/articles/mechanistic-interpretability-ai-llms）。这些稀疏特征电路已被用于给分类器去偏、引导模型拒绝有害请求等下游干预。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    DNN[深度模型] --&gt; Q{解释粒度}&#10;    Q --&gt;|输入哪里重要| Sal[显著性: 梯度/Grad-CAM/IG]&#10;    Q --&gt;|哪个 token 被关注| Att[注意力可视化-仅线索]&#10;    Q --&gt;|内部如何运算| Mech[机制可解释性]&#10;    Mech --&gt; SAE[稀疏自编码器&lt;br/&gt;分解出单义特征]&#10;    SAE --&gt; CT[电路追踪&lt;br/&gt;构造替换模型]&#10;    CT --&gt; AG[归因图&lt;br/&gt;追踪单次推理路径]&#10;    Sal --&gt; Use[调试/可视化/合规]&#10;    Att --&gt; Use&#10;    AG --&gt; Adv[去偏/引导/安全干预]\">flowchart TD\n    DNN[深度模型] --&gt; Q{解释粒度}\n    Q --&gt;|输入哪里重要| Sal[显著性: 梯度/Grad-CAM/IG]\n    Q --&gt;|哪个 token 被关注| Att[注意力可视化-仅线索]\n    Q --&gt;|内部如何运算| Mech[机制可解释性]\n    Mech --&gt; SAE[稀疏自编码器&lt;br/&gt;分解出单义特征]\n    SAE --&gt; CT[电路追踪&lt;br/&gt;构造替换模型]\n    CT --&gt; AG[归因图&lt;br/&gt;追踪单次推理路径]\n    Sal --&gt; Use[调试/可视化/合规]\n    Att --&gt; Use\n    AG --&gt; Adv[去偏/引导/安全干预]</pre><h2 id=\"怎么选\">怎么选</h2><p>实务上分三档。要快速看 CNN 关注哪块区域，用 Grad-CAM；要满足公理、对外可交代的输入归因，用积分梯度；研究大语言模型内部机制、做安全对齐，才上机制可解释性这套重型工具——它强大但成本高、仍在快速演进，2026 年远未到「一键可用」。无论哪一档，都别忘了把结果交给<a href=\"evaluation-trust\">评估与可信度</a>做忠实性检验，也别踩<a href=\"pitfalls\">陷阱与误读</a>里「漂亮的热力图 ≠ 正确的解释」那个坑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>表格模型的解释工具不适用于高维像素/词向量，深度模型需专门方法。</li>\n<li>梯度显著性是基础（SmoothGrad 去噪、Grad-CAM 定位区域），但朴素梯度噪声大、不满足完备性。</li>\n<li>积分梯度沿基线路径积分梯度，满足完备性公理，与 SHAP 同属公理归因家族，但依赖基线选择。</li>\n<li>注意力权重只是线索不是忠实归因，「Attention is not Explanation」之争提醒别把它当贡献度读。</li>\n<li>机制可解释性是 2026 前沿：SAE 分解单义特征、电路追踪构造替换模型并画归因图，约 70% 特征可解释。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"深度模型解释","id":"深度模型解释"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"基于梯度的显著性","id":"基于梯度的显著性"},{"level":2,"text":"积分梯度：带公理的归因","id":"积分梯度-带公理的归因"},{"level":2,"text":"注意力是不是解释","id":"注意力是不是解释"},{"level":2,"text":"机制可解释性：2026 的前沿","id":"机制可解释性-2026-的前沿"},{"level":2,"text":"怎么选","id":"怎么选"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"反事实解释","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/explainable-ai/local-methods/counterfactual"},"next":{"title":"评估与可信度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/explainable-ai/practice/evaluation-trust"}}